Package: assisto-guardbox
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Assisto <support@lifeassisto.com>
Section: video
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), adduser, ca-certificates, curl
Recommends: alsa-utils
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://lifeassisto.com
Description: Assisto Guard Box - AI guard for the CCTV cameras you already have
 Watches the shop's or home's own IP cameras / DVR on the local network,
 runs person and motion detection ON THIS BOX, and sends only alerts with
 one small picture and short clips to the owner's Assisto app. Works on slow
 or no internet (alerts wait and are sent later), reports power cuts and
 internet outages, plays the owner's siren or recorded warning on this
 box's speaker, and checks the DVR's health. Camera passwords stay on
 this box, encrypted. No face recognition.
